#, python-format
msgid "Saved the employment contract (version %(n)d)."
msgstr "雇用契約を保存しました（第 %(n)d 版）。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Created the filing task: %(kind)s. Check whether the notification is "
"required."
msgstr "届出タスクを起票しました: %(kind)s。届出が必要かを確かめてください。"

#, python-format
msgid "Created the filing task: %(kind)s."
msgstr "届出タスクを起票しました: %(kind)s。"

msgid ""
"The working conditions change after conversion. Attach annex 2 of the "
"employment conditions (form 1-6)."
msgstr "無期転換後の労働条件が変わります。雇用条件書（参考様式第1-6号）の別紙2 を添付してください。"

#, python-format
msgid "Attach documents to version %(n)d"
msgstr "第 %(n)d 版への根拠資料の添付"

msgid ""
"Evidence of equal pay, the calendar and agreement for variable working "
"hours, or annex 2 (conditions after conversion). The version itself is not "
"changed. Keep new annual calendars, agreements and wage rules in the "
"documents of the host organization (per site) instead: they are chosen "
"automatically by the period."
msgstr ""
"同等報酬の根拠資料、変形労働時間制のカレンダーと協定書、または別紙２（無期転換後の労働条件）。版そのものは変わりません。新しい年間カレンダー・協定書・賃金規程は、受入れ機関の書類（事業所ごと）に保管してください。対象期間で自動で選ばれます。"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "追加"

msgid "Added the attachments."
msgstr "添付を追加しました。"

msgid "Example: a document of another contract was attached."
msgstr "例: ほかの契約の資料を添付した。"

msgid "Voided the attachment."
msgstr "添付を取り消しました。"

msgid "Register the termination"
msgstr "終了を登録"

msgid ""
"The notification of termination (within 14 days) is created on the "
"dashboard. For dismissal or company reasons and other reasons, the "
"notification of difficulty in acceptance is also created."
msgstr "雇用契約終了届出（14 日以内）のタスクがダッシュボードに出ます。解雇・会社都合とその他の理由では、受入れ困難届出のタスクも出ます。"

msgid "Registered the termination. The notification task was created."
msgstr "終了を登録しました。届出タスクを起票しました。"

msgid "Example: the termination was registered for the wrong contract."
msgstr "例: 別の契約に終了を登録した。"

msgid "Cancel the termination"
msgstr "終了を取り消す"

msgid ""
"Only for correcting a mistake. Notification tasks not yet started are "
"cancelled with this reason. Tasks in progress are kept and marked; submitted"
" or closed tasks get a note."
msgstr ""
"入力の誤りを直すときだけ使います。未着手の届出タスクは、この理由で取消になります。対応中のタスクは残して印を付け、提出済み・完了などのタスクにはメモを付けます。"

msgid "Cancelled the termination."
msgstr "終了を取り消しました。"

