msgstr "Ⅲ欄７「支援の適正性を確保していることの有無」の申告が無いため、空のままにします。"

msgid ""
"Choose the reason: the date of the application for relief measures, or the "
"specific unavoidable reason."
msgstr "理由を選んでください（措置を申請した日、または具体的なやむを得ない理由）。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(count)s value has no registered translation and is printed in Japanese."
msgid_plural ""
"%(count)s values have no registered translation and are printed in Japanese."
msgstr[0] "訳が登録されていない値が %(count)s 件あり、日本語のまま出ます（氏名・住所などは数えません）。"

#, python-format
msgid "\"%(label)s\" does not fit in its field even at %(size)s pt."
msgstr "「%(label)s」は %(size)s pt でも欄に収まりません。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The version applied on %(day)s is version %(applied)d, not version "
"%(number)d shown in the form."
msgstr "%(day)s に適用される版は第%(applied)d版で、様式に出す第%(number)d版ではありません。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"\"%(label)s\" has %(count)d rows, but the form has %(limit)d. The rows after"
" that are not printed (the totals include all rows); list them in a separate"
" document."
msgstr ""
"「%(label)s」は %(count)d 行ありますが、様式の行は %(limit)d "
"行です。超えた行は出ません（合計はすべての行で計算します）。任意の様式の別紙に書いてください。"

msgid ""
"The monthly working hours are empty, so the hourly amount cannot be checked."
msgstr "月の所定労働時間数が空のため、１時間当たりの金額を確かめられません。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The hourly amount (annex 1) is empty. It is %(amount)s yen by calculation."
msgstr "１時間当たりの金額（別紙１）が空です。計算では %(amount)s 円です。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The hourly amount (%(entered)s yen) differs from the base wage divided by "
"the scheduled working hours (%(amount)s yen; Ordinance for Enforcement of "
"the Labor Standards Act, Article 19)."
msgstr ""
"１時間当たりの金額（%(entered)s 円）が、基本賃金を所定労働時間数で割った額（%(amount)s 円。労働基準法施行規則 "
"第19条）と違います。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The monthly working hours (%(monthly)s) differ from the annual working hours"
" divided by 12 (%(average)s). When the hours differ by month, use the "
"monthly average over a year."
msgstr ""
"月の所定労働時間数（%(monthly)s）が、年の所定労働時間数を 12 "
"で割った値（%(average)s）と違います。月によって時間数が違う場合は、1 年間の 1 か月平均を使います。"

#, python-format
msgid "%(hours)d h %(minutes)02d min"
msgstr "%(hours)d 時間 %(minutes)02d 分"

msgid ""
"The contact points (IX 4 and 5) are entered as one text, so the whole text "
