msgstr "発行日が基準日の 3 か月より前です（原本は発行後 3 か月以内のもの）。"

msgid "The issue date of the document is not entered."
msgstr "書類の発行日が入っていません。"

msgid ""
"The annual calendar is not written in both Japanese and the worker's support"
