msgstr "労働法令違反の疑いが「あり」なので、基準不適合等は「あり」にしてください。"

msgid "Enter section 4 only when there is a non-conformity."
msgstr "４ は基準不適合等が「あり」のときだけ入れます。"

msgid "Enter the details."
msgstr "内容を入れてください。"

msgid "Select the action for the worker."
msgstr "1号特定技能外国人への対応を選んでください。"

msgid "Enter the authority."
msgstr "案内した機関を入れてください。"

msgid "Select whether the host was notified."
msgstr "責任者への通知の有無を選んでください。"

msgid "Enter who was notified."
msgstr "通知の相手方を入れてください。"

msgid "Select whether the host was guided to the agency."
msgstr "出入国在留管理庁への案内の済み・未了を選んでください。"

msgid ""
"Enter why the report to the authorities has not been made (including not "
"needed)."
msgstr "関係行政機関への通報が未了の理由を入れてください（通報不要と判断した場合を含む）。"

msgid ""
"Choose an active staff member of this office who is marked as a support "
"manager."
msgstr "この事務所の、支援責任者の印のある有効な担当者を選んでください。"

msgid "Enter a passport number of 6 to 12 letters and digits."
msgstr "旅券番号は英数字 6〜12 桁で入力してください。"

msgid "Choose a different staff member from the current one."
msgstr "今と違う人を選んでください。"

msgid "The start date cannot be in the future."
msgstr "開始日に未来の日は入れられません。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Enter a date after %(day)s (the start of the current one). To correct the "
"current one, void it first."
msgstr "%(day)s（今の行の開始日）より後の日を入れてください。今の行を直すときは、先に取り消してください。"

msgid "Not generated, so it is not included."
msgstr "未生成のため綴じません。"

msgid "Still being generated, so it is not included."
msgstr "生成中のため綴じません。"

msgid "Generated only for another contract or version, so it is not included."
msgstr "ほかの契約・版を対象にした生成物しか無いため綴じません。"

msgid "Not signed yet: the generated PDF without the signature is included."
msgstr "署名待ちです。署名の無い生成した PDF を綴じます。"

msgid "Not attached, so it is not included."
msgstr "添付が無いため綴じません。"

msgid ""
"Required (it cannot be omitted because the host organization is not marked "
"as already accepting workers this year). The system cannot make it: add the "
"file."
msgstr ""
"要る書類です（受入れ機関に「同一年度内に特定技能外国人を受け入れている」の印が無いので省略できません）。システムでは作れないので、ファイルを足してください。"

msgid "The membership has expired, so it is not included."
msgstr "加入の有効期限を過ぎているため綴じません。"

msgid "The examination was too long before the application."
msgstr "受診日が申請に使える時期より前です。"

msgid "The examination date is not entered."
msgstr "受診日が登録されていません。"

msgid ""
"Only the assigned staff member and administrators can include this sensitive"
" document, so it is not included."
msgstr "要配慮の書類は担当者と管理者だけが綴じられるため、綴じません。"

msgid "You cannot open this file, so it is not included."
msgstr "このファイルを開く権限が無いため綴じません。"

msgid ""
"The file cannot be read as a PDF or an image (broken or password-protected),"
" so it is not included."
msgstr "PDF・画像として読めない（壊れている・パスワード付き）ため綴じません。"

msgid ""
"The worker's support language is Chinese, but only the Japanese version of "
"this form is generated (generate the bilingual version or the Chinese "
"translation)."
msgstr "支援言語が中国語ですが、この様式は日本語の版だけが生成されています（日中併記の版か中国語の訳文を生成してください）。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The total size is over the limit of the online application system (%(limit)s"
" MB including the photo). Attach what fits and submit the rest with the "
"declaration on attaching documents (reference form 9)."
msgstr ""
"在留申請オンラインシステムの上限（顔写真を含め %(limit)s "
